description=Continues "Life and Living" TV broadcasting after day 9. <LINE>
description=When the original 9 days end, the shows start over from the first episode, with the same time slots, XP and recipes as vanilla. <LINE>
description=Good in case you die and would like to continue the same world with a different character. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=<H2>Sandbox options <LINE>
description=<TEXT>* Rerun Schedule: Back to back (starts again the day after it ends) or Monthly (airs from the 1st to the 10th of every in-game month). <LINE>
description=* Days Off Air: days between reruns. Ignored in Monthly mode. <LINE>
description=* Reruns Give XP Again: if on, you get XP on every watch until your own "Media XP Level Cutoff" sandbox limit is met. If off, you only get XP from each show once per character. Reruns still lower boredom and teach any recipes you missed. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Works in SP. <LINE>
description=Should work in MP, but it was not tested. <LINE>
description=Can be added to existing saves. If the channel already went off the air, it comes back the day you load in. <LINE>
description=Does not replace game files. You still need a powered TV.
